cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the islam.museum dataset, please cite it using the preferred citation below: the Zenodo concept DOI, which always resolves to the newest archived version, so citations aggregate on one record. If you use the code, cite this repository."
title: "islam.museum — an open digital museum of Islam"
abstract: "A free, open, all-digital museum of Islam implemented as a knowledge graph in git: language-neutral records and trilingual prose (Arabic, English, Urdu), published as a static site and a public API. Data CC0 1.0, prose CC BY-SA 4.0, code MIT."
authors:
