  abstract: "The islam.museum dataset: the museum's knowledge graph of Islamic history (records, sourced relations and prose in Arabic, English and Urdu), archived on Zenodo under a concept DOI. Cite this concept DOI, not a single version DOI, so every citation lands on one record; a version DOI may be added only to pin the exact snapshot analysed."
